{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of Black Signal \u2014 a covert unit operating in the shadows of modern warfare.<br><strong>War has changed. Instead of territory, nations fight for information. Your mission is simple: infiltrate secured</strong> locations, steal a computer, and get out before anyone notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a loud firefight \u2014 it\u2019s tactical infiltration. Limited ammo, one robotic spider per mission, and no backup. Stay low, observe patrol routes, deploy your drone, breach camera systems, and disappear before alarms trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective:<br><strong>Get in. Secure the device. Get out.</strong><br>Clean, quiet, controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make mistakes and the mission collapses fast. You\u2019re not here to destroy the world \u2014 you're here to steal its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> to jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift</strong> to run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ctrl</strong> to crouch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to shoot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> to reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>V</strong> to deploy the spider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to detonate the spider \u2014 used to take down an enemy or affect certain objects in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong> to access cameras near a cable box</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143570?t=1762852076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143570?t=1762852076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143570/154f60962d80a4548a3651a86d030eb58450c4e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762852076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143570/154f60962d80a4548a3651a86d030eb58450c4e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762852076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mild violence. Players can neutralize guards using firearms or explosive drones. There is no blood, gore, or graphic depiction of injury. The game focuses on stealth and strategic extraction rather than combat."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of Black Signal \u2014 a covert unit operating in the shadows of modern warfare.<br><strong>War has changed. Instead of territory, nations fight for information. Your mission is simple: infiltrate secured</strong> locations, steal a computer, and get out before anyone notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a loud firefight \u2014 it\u2019s tactical infiltration. Limited ammo, one robotic spider per mission, and no backup. Stay low, observe patrol routes, deploy your drone, breach camera systems, and disappear before alarms trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective:<br><strong>Get in. Secure the device. Get out.</strong><br>Clean, quiet, controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make mistakes and the mission collapses fast. You\u2019re not here to destroy the world \u2014 you're here to steal its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> to jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift</strong> to run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ctrl</strong> to crouch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to shoot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> to reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>V</strong> to deploy the spider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to detonate the spider \u2014 used to take down an enemy or affect certain objects in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong> to access cameras near a cable box</p></li></ul>","developers":["Matthew Lalande"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143570/5ef75aec7cc06253da4e8cf10bfb596f613b5b46/header.jpg?t=1762852076","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 Sonoma<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400H @ 2.70GHz 2.69 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1.78 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.78  GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4143570/368156960/4810d75f7cbcaff07895b7220df3f90f5c562104/1762180282/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762538962","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4143570/368156960/4810d75f7cbcaff07895b7220df3f90f5c562104/1762180282/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762538962","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4143570/368156960/4810d75f7cbcaff07895b7220df3f90f5c562104/1762180282/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762538962","id":257226166,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257226166/movie480.mp4?t=1762538962","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257226166/movie_max.mp4?t=1762538962"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226166/33acce12aa10658b5bd64a387b82e831f4c986f4/movie_